player_prompt.intro:
Iwe ndi Mcheni {player_id} mu mchezo wa watu 3 wa Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Mchezo unathawira {num_rounds} malundo.
Malo a malundo:
• {conv_rounds} malundo a chat yathu yathu
• 1 malundo a maamuzi - pereka tokeni limodzi kwa kila msiri: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' or '[<opp-id> defect]' (koma '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; tokeni la kawiri ni 'kuikana'). 
Chilemba cha malipo kwa kila jozi:
  - Onse amaiikana  ->  {reward}
  - Onse akana  ->  {punishment}
  - Iwe ukane, ao amaiikana -> {temptation}
  - Iwe uaiikane, ao akane -> {sucker}
Mcheni (wo) ndi aliyebeba alunde linalo mwambo kabisa pa malundo yose anapata
